g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/nkqj52zzbg0j2py017jn8onk610ino7.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E7%83%88%E5%85%89%E5%85%B7%E8%A3%85.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ec/nkqj52zzbg0j2py017jn8onk610ino7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />烈光具装\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，最大生命提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">20%</font>；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冲阵减伤</font></span>]效果：受到伤害额外降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；造成伤害后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">反应技能</span>]冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，最大生命提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冲阵减伤</font></span>]效果：受到伤害额外降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>；造成伤害后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">反应技能</span>]冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，最大生命提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冲阵减伤</font></span>]效果：受到伤害额外降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>；造成伤害后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">反应技能</span>]冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj